5)) find 2nd highest number

code:

import java.util.*;

class SecondHighest {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<Integer> l = Arrays.asList(11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16);

        // Find 2nd highest using streams
        Optional<Integer> secondHighest = l.stream()
                .sorted(Comparator.reverseOrder())
                .skip(1)
                .findFirst();

        System.out.println(secondHighest.orElse(null));
    }
}


output:
15
